INC-SOURCE (P-T)
           (D-D)
SAMPLE      2.8 cm diameter, 2.55 cm high sample of holmium
            metal weighing 143.03 g and located 15 cm
            from the target.
METHOD     (TOF)  TOF used in conjunction with attenuation
                   method for total cross-section measurements.
DETECTOR   (SCIN) NE213 liquid scintillator coupled to a
                   philips XP1040 photomultiplier tube for
                   the scattering experiments.
STATUS     (NDD) From NEUDADA, some originally from private
                   communication, Zago, 28/01/1972, some from
                   text of publication.
